      "proposed_id": "rule_dual_class",
      "proposed_label": "The Character with Two Classes",
      "question": "Should 'rule_dual_class' be added to the canonical node registry? Builder may not mint node identity.",
      "edges_depending_on_it": [
        "G3",
        "G4",
        "G5",
        "G6"
      ],
      "why_needed": "The registry holds rule_multiclass at degree 14 but nothing for the human dual-class rule, which this packet gives a section of its own and which works differently: the character stops advancing in the original class rather than dividing experience between classes. Collapsing the two would make the graph unable to distinguish \"what breaks if multi-classing changes\" from \"what breaks if dual-classing changes\"."
    },
    {
      "kind": "node_registration",
      "proposed_id": "rule_tracking",
